research/audit/wave6-refuter-tasks/cex-limsup-infinite-not-attained-in-r.md:3224:[L12] The order on $\mathbb{N}$ is total and transitive, so any two indices have a common upper bound ([[def-nat-order]], [[thm-nat-linear-order]]).
